{"id":"k91x4tle99x9ml1pdskd8bvm8","title":"口腔溃疡反复的原因及微生物干预探索","originalTitle":"[转载]口腔溃疡总反复？先看懂原因，再找到适合自己的应对办法（上）","summary":"复发性口腔溃疡与遗传、免疫、营养、激素变化、生活方式等因素有关。研究发现溃疡活动期与愈合期的口腔微生物组成不同，某些菌属如Fusobacterium和Leptotrichia与活动性溃疡相关，而Selenomonas和Streptococcus在愈合黏膜中增多。健康植物性饮食可能降低溃疡风险，但具体机制尚需进一步研究。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=2040048&do=blog&id=1560832"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T01:51:35.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T06:57:58.782Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T06:57:58.782Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果"],"score":42,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9c3db51f-358d-47a6-84a1-adb1e6f2424c","title":"复发性口腔溃疡微生物与免疫机制研究新进展"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9c3db51f-358d-47a6-84a1-adb1e6f2424c","title":"复发性口腔溃疡微生物与免疫机制研究新进展"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fDyo1hRL9oIs","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}